| Component | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| **Storage Slot 0** | Holds the implementation contract address |
| **Selector `0xa619486e`** | Returns the implementation address (similar to `masterCopy()` in Gnosis Safe) |
| **Fallback** | Delegates all other calls via `delegatecall` |
| **Payable** | Both fallback and receive accept ETH |

