|------|----------|------|
| 0 | `_authorizations` | `mapping(address => uint256)` |
| 1 | `totalSupply` | `uint256` |
| 2 | `_balances` | `mapping(address => uint256)` |
| 3 | `_allowances` | `mapping(address => mapping(address => uint256))` |
| 4 | `_nonces` | `mapping(address => uint256)` |
| 0xf0c5... | `_initFlags` | `uint256` (packed) |
| 0xfe36... | `_implementation` | `address` (EIP-1967) |

